{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"DEU","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"申命記","commonName":"申命記","title":"申命記","order":5,"numberOfChapters":34,"sha256":"5c99d640766f4ea11b4ca8e01cfd5ad9c5deadc5b6eb8918cde0bde55312a45e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/DEU/1.json","lastChapterNumber":34,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/DEU/34.json","totalNumberOfVerses":949},"chapter":{"number":33,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["摩西最後的祝福"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是上帝的僕人摩西臨終時給以色列人的祝福："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"「耶和華從西奈山來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從西珥山向我們顯現，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂從巴蘭山發出光輝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂帶著千萬聖者來臨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂右邊有閃耀的光芒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂深愛自己的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾聖者都聽命於祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"伏在祂的腳前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"領受祂的訓誨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩西將律法頒佈給我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作為雅各子孫的產業。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"百姓的眾首領齊聚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列各支派集合之時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華在耶書崙做王。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福呂便支派說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「儘管呂便人數稀少，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他存活，不致滅沒。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福猶大支派說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你聽猶大人的呼求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"帶他們回歸本族，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"出手為他們爭戰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"幫他們對抗仇敵。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福利未支派說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你把土明和烏陵賜給虔誠的利未人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾經在瑪撒試驗他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在米利巴泉邊與他們爭論。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為了聽從你的話，遵守你的約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們不顧父母，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"捨棄弟兄，拋下兒女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們把你的典章傳授給雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把你的律法傳授給以色列；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要把香獻在你面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把全牲燔祭獻在你的壇上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你賜他們力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"悅納他們的工作，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擊碎仇敵的腰桿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使敵人一蹶不振。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福便雅憫支派說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「耶和華所愛的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"安居在祂身邊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"安居在祂懷中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"終日蒙祂庇護。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福約瑟家族說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「願他們的土地蒙耶和華賜福，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"得天上的甘霖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"及地下的泉源；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"得日月之輝，物產豐美；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"得古老群山之精華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"永存丘陵之富饒；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"得大地的豐肥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蒙荊棘火中之上帝的恩寵。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願這些福氣落在約瑟頭上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"臨到弟兄中的王者身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"約瑟威武如頭生的公牛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有野牛的角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他用角牴萬邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到地極。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的兩角是數以萬計的以法蓮人和數以千計的瑪拿西人。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福西布倫和以薩迦支派說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「願西布倫人欣然外出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願以薩迦人在帳篷中歡喜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要招聚眾人上山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一同獻上公義的祭；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們汲取海裡的財富和沙中的寶藏。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福迦得支派說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「擴張迦得疆界的那位當受稱頌！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦得蹲伏如母獅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撕碎頭顱和臂膀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他為自己選了最好的土地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是留給首領的那份。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他與眾首領同行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"施行耶和華的公義和祂給以色列的典章。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福但支派說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「但像一隻從巴珊躍出的幼獅。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福拿弗他利支派說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「拿弗他利人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們飽嘗耶和華的恩寵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"滿得祂的賜福，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擁有西方和南方的土地。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"摩西祝福亞設支派說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「願亞設在眾子中最蒙福，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"受眾弟兄的恩待，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雙腳沐浴橄欖油，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城門有銅鎖鐵閂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一生都充滿力量。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"text":"「耶書崙啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝獨一無二，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂馳騁諸天，前來助你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"穿越長空，充滿威嚴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亙古的上帝是你的庇護，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂永恆的臂膀是你的依託。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂趕走你面前的仇敵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"下令毀滅他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列安然居住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各獨居一處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那裡盛產五穀新酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有天上的雨露滋潤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，你多麼有福！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蒙耶和華拯救之人啊，誰能像你？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂是你的盾牌，你得勝的寶劍。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敵人要向你屈服，被你踐踏。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/DEU/33.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/DEU/34.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/DEU/32.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":29}